  "bio": [
    "I am a biomedical engineer and bioinformatician. I lead bioinformatics at the Institute of Medical Genetics in Oldenburg, where I develop tools and pipelines for analysing next-generation sequencing data, with a focus on the genetics and genomics of congenital heart disease.",
    "I started out in protein characterization and proteomics, and my main background is in bioinformatics: building software for large-scale biological data. That work now extends to high-throughput genomic technologies."
